### 4. Integration with the Muthoot FinCorp ONE "One-Stop Shop"

The Muthoot FinCorp ONE app is the vehicle for "unlocking personalised financial solutions." AI agents will transition the app from a reactive tool to a predictive financial partner.

**Top 3 Enhanced App Features via AI Agents:**
1.  **AI-Driven Personalization Engine:** Utilizing the specific "Reference Price" formula—calculating the lower of the 30-day average or the preceding day's closing price—the agent provides personalized LTV (Loan-to-Value) alerts. It advises customers on their borrowing capacity in real-time as gold rates fluctuate.
2.  **Multimodal Installment Assistant:** A proactive SaaS module that helps customers simulate and manage "Income Generation" versus "Consumption" loans, providing real-time adjustments to repayment schedules based on the borrower's varying monthly capacity.
3.  **Unified Ecosystem SaaS Extension:** This AI framework is designed as a standardized SaaS offering that can be instantly extended to subsidiaries like **Muthoot Microfin** and **Muthoot Housing**. This ensures shared data intelligence across the "Muthoot Blue" ecosystem, creating a unified customer view and consistent service standards regardless of the specific product line.

