### 5. Risk Mitigation and Security Intelligence

AI agents must reinforce the "Caution Notice" by acting as a real-time compliance and security engine, protecting the "common man" from "unscrupulous persons" and "fake sanction letters."

**Security & Compliance Checklist:**
- [ ] **Official Channel Validator:** An AI agent that uses the "Branch Locator" tool to verify the authenticity of any employee or agent, ensuring customers only deal with "established and official branches."
- [ ] **Credential Guard:** Automated conversational interceptors that prevent and report any request for sensitive data like **PIN, CVV, or Internet Passwords**, as per the Caution Notice.
- [ ] **Regulatory LTV Compliance Engine:** A logic-layer agent that ensures every loan offer automatically adheres to the latest "regulatory guidelines" and "Reference Price" calculations (22kt basis).
- [ ] **Document Authenticity Bot:** A SaaS tool for customers to scan and verify the authenticity of any "cash receipt" or "loan sanction letter" to detect fraudulent claims instantly.

